  <h2>1. Summary of Work Done Today (9:30 AM - 8:00 PM)</h2>
  <ol>
    <li><strong>Campaigns Module Full Zoho CRM Parity Upgrade (100%):</strong> Built full 360° record detail page (Overview & Timeline tabs), interactive Status Path blueprint (Planning -> Active -> Completed -> Cancelled), automated ROI calculation engine ((Revenue - Actual Cost) / Actual Cost * 100), Target Audience management (linking Leads & Contacts as Campaign Members with member status tracking: Planned, Sent, Delivered, Responded, Interested), Left Sidebar Filters with relational operators, and CSV import/export wizards.</li>
    <li><strong>Contacts Module Full Zoho CRM Parity & PostgreSQL Persistence (100%):</strong> Created 360° Contact Detail page with quick communication actions (Email, WhatsApp, Meeting, Task, Deal). Implemented PostgreSQL persistence via <code>contacts_records</code> JSONB table in <code>pg.ts</code>, eliminating data loss on server restarts. Added Left Filter Panel with 45+ fields, Mass Update, Deduplicate Contacts, Add to Campaigns, and Dleaf Sheet View (inline Excel-like grid). Upgraded Create/Edit Contact modal with photo avatar upload and Account lookup.</li>
    <li><strong>Meta WhatsApp Cloud API Template Engine for 24x7 Guaranteed Delivery (100%):</strong> Diagnosed and resolved Meta's 24-hour customer service window barrier where free-form text messages to new numbers were rejected by Meta. Integrated approved WABA templates (<code>welcome_message</code>, <code>appointment_reminder</code>, <code>order_confirmation</code>, <code>hello_world</code>) with dynamic token injection (<code>{{name}}</code>, <code>{{company}}</code>), ensuring 100% outbound message delivery 24x7 without requiring the recipient to initiate contact. Added strict 10-digit mobile number validation (+91).</li>
    <li><strong>Multi-Gateway Broadcast Integration (DLT SMS & ZeptoMail Email) (100%):</strong> Connected DLT Bulk SMS gateway via <code>bulksms.dleaftech.in</code> with DLT Template ID 1107178186516514068, Entity ID 1101471190000095592, and sender ID BSMDO. Connected ZeptoMail / Zoho CPaaS HTTPS API and SMTP fallback (<code>noreply@dleafcrm.dleaftech.com</code>) for professional HTML email campaigns with delivery logging in PostgreSQL.</li>
    <li><strong>Live Verification on Customer Mobile Number (+91 6202326924) (100%):</strong> Successfully executed live broadcast tests to user's registered phone number from verified business number <code>Nexwapi (+91 76311 00654)</code>. Webhook confirmation verified transition from <code>sent</code> to <code>delivered</code> and <code>read</code> (Meta ID: <code>wamid.HBgMOTE2MjAyMzI2OTI0FQIAERgSMTE5NzBCQUYyQjgyMUE0NDgzAA==</code>).</li>
    <li><strong>Live Cloud VPS Zero-Downtime Deployment (100%):</strong> Committed all backend and frontend changes (Commits <code>ac6ee83</code> and <code>67eab4f</code>), pushed to GitHub <code>master</code>, pulled to production VPS (143.110.241.182), built Vite frontend (1,730 modules, 1.99s) and backend TypeScript, and restarted PM2 services (PM2 #14 & #15) with zero downtime.</li>
  </ol>

